														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1048619">
									

<p>This is much too short and kind of boring. I imagine containment dialogue went something like this.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>"It lists the official leaders of the United States!"</p>
<p>"…and?"</p>
<p>"It lists leaders that haven't happened yet!"</p>
<p>"…and?"</p>
<p>"The list suddenly ends, implying that the US stops existing!"</p>
<p>"…and?"</p>
<p>"Uh, no, that's… that's pretty much it, really."</p>
<p>"So what makes this an SCP and not an anomalous item?"</p>
<p>"Uhhhhhhh… I dunno, come t' think of it. But I've already written the report."</p>
<p>"Oh fine."</p>
</blockquote>
<p>It's insubstantial, seen? This concept could work as part of a larger something, but as a standalone piece it's really very meh.</p>

							</div>

								
